    "Research overlay only; persistent Shipyard SQLite is never replaced by this package.",
    "Visualization is functionally frozen as a consumer: GLB library/workspace remains available but is no longer the primary development lane.",
    "The first bounded generative campaign evaluates 10 Wayfarer configuration probes under the declared S1 adequacy contract, retains 6 survivors, rejects 4 for traceable admitted constraints, and retains a 4-member Pareto frontier.",
    "Every surviving candidate compiles through governed synthesis -> semantic geometry -> semantic GLB and is registered as a separate GOVERNED_SEMANTIC asset in the same Shipyard SQLite.",
    "Candidate lineage, choices, objectives, rejections, Pareto membership, GLB hashes, and Vehicle Dynamics Contract hashes are persisted in additive campaign tables.",
    "Current admitted architecture variation changes packaging and semantic geometry but does not yet change ordinary translational Torch mission behavior because wet mass, remass, and Torch operating cards remain fixed.",
